{
	"name": "Sacramental Blade",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/magic/symbols/runes-etched-steel-blade.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>As part of the attack action, you deal basic melee damage to yourself as you perform a sacrament on your weapon. So infused, your weapon attacks this round gain advantage against fey, fiends, and undead until the start of your next turn and deal radiant damage instead of the weapon’s normal damage type. In addition, if any fey, fiend, or undead deals damage to you with a melee attack before the start of your next turn, you may counterattack with your sacramental weapon as a reaction.</p>",
